WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.340
Quote requests: what customers sent: answers, photos and files; the quote is built from here.

2
00:00:08.893 --> 00:00:12.670
Open a "New" request and look at the answers and photos.

3
00:00:13.224 --> 00:00:16.930
If you need to see it in person, click "Book a visit".

4
00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:21.830
Click "Create the quote" to open a quote filled from this request.

5
00:00:22.382 --> 00:00:26.890
Close requests you won't take with "Close request" and note why.
